      "message": "Tag the PR head sha, not the merge commit\n\nThe deploy-to-image resolver resolves git_ref to the PR HEAD commit sha, and\ntank-operator #1256 / glimmung / ambience all tag\n`github.event.pull_request.head.sha || github.sha`. On a pull_request event\n`github.sha` is the synthetic merge commit, which the resolver never sees — so\ndefault IMAGE_TAG to head.sha so the deployed image is findable. The\nworkflow_dispatch git_ref override (resolved full sha) is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
